	(text "SKB pins 1-36 -> 5x 74HCT165 (frame bit k = SKB pin k+1, then 1010 signature).\n2x 74HCT595 -> SKB 38, 40-50; 2N7002 contact-closure SAMPLE on SKB 39.\nSKB 37 = DVM earth / logic 0 = GND_ISO. See README.md for the bit map."
